The Business Card → /connect System
A complete reference for the marketing system that turns a scanned QR code into a routed digital conversation.
Owner: Michael Cabrera, Founder & CEO
Audience: USRad team — engineering, marketing, ops
Status: Shipped — May 2026
Related documents: usrad_connect_page_strategy.docx, USRad_Dual-Color_Brand_Strategy.md

1. What this is
A two-part marketing system that bridges the offline-to-online handoff: a premium printed business card and a digital landing system at usrad.com/connect that receives the QR scan and routes the visitor to the right destination.
The system exists because USRad's audience is fragmented. A single card may be handed to a radiologist, a CFO at a self-funded employer, a benefits broker, a VC partner, or a health plan executive — at the same conference, in the same week. Each of those people has a different question. The business card cannot answer six different questions at once. The /connect page can.
The one-sentence version
The business card establishes trust through physical quality; /connect translates that trust into the right next step for whoever scanned it.
